      "ending": "harbor",
      "finalBeat": "c_ending_harbor_7",
      "finalScene": "v6_end_harbor",
      "finalSceneName": "青蒲渡 · 修船开班",
      "finalBackground": "v5/quay.webp",
      "finalCG": "dawn",
      "finalCGFile": "v5/cg-dawn.webp",
      "cast": [
        {
          "id": "v6_zhaoli",
          "name": "江照鲤",
          "file": "v5/zhaoli.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_he",
          "name": "何铆",
          "file": "v5/he.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_aunt",
          "name": "汤二娘",
          "file": "v5/npc-merchant.webp"
        }
      ],
      "distinctAftermathBeats": [
        "c6_v6_after_harbor_1",
        "c6_v6_after_harbor_2",
        "c6_v6_after_harbor_3",
        "c6_v6_after_harbor_4",
        "c6_v6_after_harbor_5",
        "c6_v6_after_harbor_6"
      ],
      "endingSequence": [
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_1",
          "text": "你留在青蒲渡。护渡的差事没有让谁一夜成名，却让修桥、开仓、教人的工钱都有了着落。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_2",
          "text": "新板别急着上漆，里头还潮。今天要是不装样子，明年就不用重修。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_3",
          "text": "我这儿也是。账慢慢还，别拿一阵子风光抵一年的饭。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_4",
          "text": "我先把这根钉敲直。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_5",
          "text": "下午有一条船，过来搭手？不是有危险，就是缺人。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_6",
          "text": "来。普通的那一条，也有人要回家。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": "dawn",
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_harbor_7",
          "text": "潮又涨起来。你们没有把江湖变小，只让它在这一处，多留了一段能安稳走过的岸。",
          "scene": "v6_end_harbor",
          "cg": "dawn",
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_he",
            "v6_aunt"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ending": "name",
      "finalBeat": "c_ending_name_8",
      "finalScene": "v6_end_name",
      "finalSceneName": "青蒲坪 · 补试以后",
      "finalBackground": "v5/arena.webp",
      "finalCG": null,
      "finalCGFile": null,
      "cast": [
        {
          "id": "v6_rong",
          "name": "容既白",
          "file": "v5/rong.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_xu",
          "name": "许竞川",
          "file": "v5/xu.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_su",
          "name": "苏晚澄",
          "file": "v5/su.webp"
        }
      ],
      "distinctAftermathBeats": [
        "c6_v6_after_name_1",
        "c6_v6_after_name_2",
        "c6_v6_after_name_3",
        "c6_v6_after_name_4",
        "c6_v6_after_name_5",
        "c6_v6_after_name_6",
        "c6_v6_after_name_7"
      ],
      "endingSequence": [
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_1",
          "text": "补试那日，容既白主动来约同一块坪。棍尾换了走法，你也没把上次那一剑当成万能的解。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_2",
          "text": "再来。今天你不用让，也别以为昨天的我还站在原地。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_3",
          "text": "你们交手到最后一轮，各退半步。你凭新的一手先碰到肩衣，这一次，没有同时中身。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_4",
          "text": "记下了。只记这场，不替你写进任何大榜。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_5",
          "text": "这场就够了。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_6",
          "text": "够今天的。明年的你还得自己来。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_7",
          "text": "后来米行的人照样催工钱，馆里的瓦照样要修。可你知道自己赢过一场，也知道对手没有替你输。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_name_8",
          "text": "没有人叫你宗师。有人叫你的名字，问下一回什么时候来。你认真给了一个能赴的日期。",
          "scene": "v6_end_name",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_rong",
            "v6_xu",
            "v6_su"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ending": "together5",
      "finalBeat": "c_ending_together5_8",
      "finalScene": "v6_end_together5",
      "finalSceneName": "枫岭古道 · 同行起步",
      "finalBackground": "v5/ridge.webp",
      "finalCG": null,
      "finalCGFile": null,
      "cast": [
        {
          "id": "v6_qiao",
          "name": "乔砚生",
          "file": "v5/qiao.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_pei",
          "name": "裴雁秋",
          "file": "v6/pei-amused-v2.webp"
        }
      ],
      "distinctAftermathBeats": [
        "c6_v6_after_together_1",
        "c6_v6_after_together_2",
        "c6_v6_after_together_3",
        "c6_v6_after_together_4",
        "c6_v6_after_together_5",
        "c6_v6_after_together_6",
        "c6_v6_after_together_9",
        "c6_v6_after_together_10",
        "c6_v6_after_together_11"
      ],
      "endingSequence": [
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_1",
          "text": "你和乔砚生随镖队再上路。他的腕子还没能任意使剑，裴雁秋给他换了押尾报路的差事。",
          "scene": "v6_end_departure",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei",
            "v6_zhaoli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_2",
          "text": "以前总觉得得拿剑站最前。现在最后一个走，也能把人叫齐。",
          "scene": "v6_end_departure",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei",
            "v6_zhaoli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_3",
          "text": "我若走快了，你就喊。不许只在心里骂我。",
          "scene": "v6_end_departure",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei",
            "v6_zhaoli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_4",
          "text": "那我能一边喊一边骂吗？",
          "scene": "v6_end_departure",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei",
            "v6_zhaoli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_5",
          "text": "看前头的坡。有力气斗嘴，留一点抬车。",
          "scene": "v6_end_departure",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei",
            "v6_zhaoli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_6",
          "text": "渡口这头我守着。你们回来，别再拿米袋当刺客。",
          "scene": "v6_end_departure",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei",
            "v6_zhaoli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_7",
          "text": "你们各自背一半行李，谁也没有替另一人写完前程。",
          "scene": "v6_end_together5",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_together5_8",
          "text": "路还会分岔，伤也不会因为同行就消失。这回你们学会的，是分开之前先开口，重逢时仍肯听。",
          "scene": "v6_end_together5",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_pei"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ending": "teacher",
      "finalBeat": "c_ending_teacher_8",
      "finalScene": "v6_end_teacher",
      "finalSceneName": "石梁馆 · 第一堂课",
      "finalBackground": "v5/hall.webp",
      "finalCG": null,
      "finalCGFile": null,
      "cast": [
        {
          "id": "v6_han",
          "name": "韩鹭石",
          "file": "v5/han.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_qiao",
          "name": "乔砚生",
          "file": "v6/qiao-amused-v2.webp"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6_bao",
          "name": "包小满",
          "file": "v5/npc-youth.webp"
        }
      ],
      "distinctAftermathBeats": [
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_1",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_2",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_3",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_4",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_5",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_6",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_7",
        "c6_v6_after_teacher_8"
      ],
      "endingSequence": [
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_1",
          "text": "你回石梁馆，先养手，再教刚入门的孩子。包小满第一日就问，学多久能打赢许竞川。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_2",
          "text": "我不知道。今天先学车歪了，怎样不跟着倒。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_3",
          "text": "那不是回到搬米吗？",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_4",
          "text": "我出门一圈，也才知道原来搬米有这么多事。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_5",
          "text": "教人之前，把你那一回做错的也讲给他听。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_6",
          "text": "你照做了，没有把伤说成英雄的勋章。孩子听完，还敢问你第二遍。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_7",
          "text": "再来。今天没有谁必须先证明自己特别。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_teacher_8",
          "text": "新瓦盖住了最漏的地方。雨盆没有扔，放在门边养了一株小草。你仍在学，也开始让别人敢于学。",
          "scene": "v6_end_teacher",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_han",
            "v6_qiao",
            "v6_bao"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
