      "distinctAftermathBeats": [
        "c6_v6_after_captain_1",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_2",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_3",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_4",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_5",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_6",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_7",
        "c6_v6_after_captain_8"
      ],
      "endingSequence": [
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_1",
          "text": "你留在青蒲渡，与江照鲤分领两段水路。旧船没有凭空回来，赔船的账压在第一年的工钱里。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_2",
          "text": "当领船的人，先学会每月少买两条新腰带。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_3",
          "text": "你哪月买过？别拿笑话把该算的藏了。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_4",
          "text": "他这句我同意。今天还差谁的船钱，先报清。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_5",
          "text": "我报。还有，明天那段我想自己掌桨，你们在岸上看一次。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_6",
          "text": "好。我先看你准备，不替你把每个险处都走掉。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_7",
          "text": "红绳挂在新船头，末端还是能一手解开的活结。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c_ending_captain_8",
          "text": "后来有人问，那年是谁救了渡口。照鲤把船册翻开，指给他看许多个名字。你的名字在其中，有自己的那一段。",
          "scene": "v6_end_captain",
          "cg": null,
          "cast": [
            "v6_zhaoli",
            "v6_du",
            "v6_cheng"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
